00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:05,820
Caminal Juyu, this site is located in the heart of the Maya Highlands and was established around Lake Mirafloris.

2
00:00:05,820 --> 00:00:14,560
It was a center of exchange and trade that controlled the distribution routes for jade, obsidian, salt, cotton, resins, and other products.

